ROOT CAUSE ANALYSIS
===========================================================================================

Primary Incident

Azure Subscription API experienced repeated Gateway Timeout (HTTP 504), preventing subscription activation.

Secondary Incident

ARM deployment validation failed because the subscription never entered an Active state.

Tertiary Incident

Storage Account provisioning failed due to regional capacity exhaustion (HTTP 409 RegionCapacityUnavailable). Retry in East US 2 also failed because the Resource Group was never successfully created.

