BUSINESS IMPACT
===========================================================================================

• Subscription provisioning failed.

• Resource Group was never created.

• Storage Account deployment aborted.

• Infrastructure deployment pipeline stopped.

• Application onboarding delayed.

===========================================================================================
RECOMMENDATIONS
===========================================================================================

• Implement exponential retry for Azure Subscription API.

• Validate subscription state before ARM deployment.

• Perform ARM template validation prior to execution.

• Enable Azure Service Health checks before provisioning.

• Configure automatic region failover for Storage Accounts.

• Retry deployment only after subscription activation succeeds.

• Add dependency validation between provisioning stages.

